sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Bob as Bob (browser)
  participant MW as Middleware pipeline
  participant C as AuctionController
  participant S as BiddingStrategy
  participant M as Models and MySQL
  participant O as Observers
  actor Others as Everyone else

  Bob->>MW: { type: PLACE_BID, auctionId, amount }
  MW->>MW: parse, log, rate limit, validate, authenticate
  MW->>C: router calls placeBid()
  C->>M: load auction and its bids
  C->>S: validateBid()
  S-->>C: ok (or an error is thrown)
  C->>M: save the bid
  C->>O: notify BID_PLACED
  O-->>Others: BroadcastObserver sends AUCTION_UPDATED and NEW_BID
  O-->>Others: OutbidObserver tells the previous leader
  O->>O: AuditLogObserver writes the log line
  C-->>Bob: BID_ACCEPTED
